# ---------------------------------------------------------------
# Build-time variables (Cloudflare Pages → Settings → Environment variables)
# ---------------------------------------------------------------
# Optional. Free access key from https://web3forms.com — every contact submission is also emailed
# to the address the key is registered to. Leads are always stored in D1 (/admin → Inbox) too.
VITE_WEB3FORMS_KEY=

# ---------------------------------------------------------------
# Server secrets are NOT set here.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------
# ADMIN_PASSWORD and SESSION_SECRET are Cloudflare Pages secrets in production
# (npx wrangler pages secret put <NAME>) and live in .dev.vars for local development
# (see .dev.vars.example). Admin login stays disabled until both are set.
